<https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn%3Aoid%3A2.49.0.1.840.0.14ed9d519b6737e4c0515a4664c0abad34579c5d.001.1#info> <https://jefflevesque.com/ontology/cap-model/hasInstruction> "Seek shelter inside a well-built structure and stay away from\nwindows. This storm is capable of producing damaging winds."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
